            ("LTA Padel: what to expect from your first padel session", "https://www.ltapadel.org.uk/news/2026/october/what-to-expect-from-your-first-padel-session/"),
            ("LTA: padel vs tennis", "https://www.lta.org.uk/play/ways-to-play/padel/padel-vs-tennis/"),
